{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>原來在家都可以自己煮到美味的艇仔粥！在 TVB 節目《阿爺廚房》中，李家鼎（鼎爺）就曾教路如何用雞殼、陳皮煲煮出香滑粥底，再配合水魷魚、豬皮、鮮蝦、豬柳等豐富食材，層次十足，非常惹味！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"90c8ec9d-0503-451a-8bb0-b9dcd6ec3e11.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20260EIYeIqlkR1789552275.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"90c8ec9d-0503-451a-8bb0-b9dcd6ec3e11.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'>艇仔粥食材</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></li></ul><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'>詳細做法</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15